	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『スター・ウォーズ／最後のジェダイ』に初登場する、巨大な四足ウォーカータイプ・AT-M6を手のひらサイズのビークルモデルシリーズで初立体化。",
			"特徴的な前足部分や、腹部ディテール",
			"まで徹底的に再現！小さいながらも圧巻の存在感！",
			"複数体飾りたくなるコレクション性の高い手のひらサイズ。複数揃えれば、劇中の迫力ある行軍シーンをイメージして楽しめます！"
		],
		"en": [
			"The AT-M6, the giant four-legged walker type that first appeared in Star Wars: The Last Jedi, is now available in a palm-sized vehicle model series for the first time.",
			"Distinctive forefoot and abdominal details",
			"Thoroughly reproduced! Although small, it has an overwhelming presence!",
			"A highly collectible palm-sized item that you'll want to display multiple pieces. If you collect more than one, you can enjoy imagining the powerful marching scene in the play!"
		]
